# Error-correction encoding circuit (paper Fig. 2)
# 3 logical qubits: a=0, b=1, c=2
# 9 gates total: 5 non-trivial (T>0) + 4 free Rz (T=0)
#
# Gate format: type q1 [q2] T level
#   type=1: single-qubit   type=2: two-qubit
#
# Derived from Table I DP trace (verified: optimal runtime=136, suboptimal=770):
#   Col 0  Y90 on a     (Ry 90°, T=1)
#   Col 1  ZZ_ab 90°    (two-qubit, T=1)
#   Col 2  Y90 on c     (Ry 90°, T=1)
#   Col 3  ZZ_bc 90°    (two-qubit, T=1)
#   Col 4  Y90 on b     (Ry 90°, T=1)
#   Col 5  Rz on a,b,c  (T=0, free — changes rotating frame, no wait time)
#   Col 6  Rz on a      (T=0, second Rz on a)
3
1 0 1.0 0
2 0 1 1.0 1
1 2 1.0 2
2 1 2 1.0 3
1 1 1.0 4
1 0 0.0 5
1 1 0.0 5
